{"resourceIdentifier":"353","resourceName":"Composting of Municipal organic waste in Mahajanga (Madagascar)","description":"The objective of the proposed project is the implementation of a composting plant for the organic fraction of the domestic waste on the existing landfill site of Mahajanga city(Madagascar).The project, which has been preceded by an experimental pilot operation, comprises: The transformation of the experimental plant into an industrial commercial plant for waste sorting and composting, with a monthly input capacity of 400 tons per month of domestic waste, for a work on a basis of 10 x 8 h-shifts per week, allowing a production of compost of 1500 tons per year.The optimisation of the process parameters to improve productivity.The building of more parallel plants allowing the production capacity to increase progressively to reach 4 000 tons per year.The development of the compost market around the city,through demonstration operations and farmers training: such market development is a prerequisite for the sustainability of the approach, after the end of the crediting periods.","location":{"latitude":-15.701944,"longitude":46.364444},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"353"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Boeny province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Goodplanet"},{"type":"string","value":"Chongqing Municipality, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Late to verify"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"353"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"14948"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.F."}]},{"code":"VAL